{"starts": [0.0, 5.280457, 12.90179, 18.209497, 22.085413, 25.938620999999998, 31.541829, 37.247287], "total": 44.355953, "segs": [{"text": "¿Qué pasa si la Tierra deja de girar de golpe? Spoiler: saldrías volando.", "words": [["Qué", 0.095458, 0.220458], ["pasa", 0.231833, 0.493208], ["si", 0.504541, 0.640916], ["la", 0.652291, 0.754582], ["Tierra", 0.765916, 1.049999], ["deja", 1.061375, 1.334083], ["de", 1.345458, 1.447749], ["girar", 1.459083, 1.788624], ["de", 1.8, 1.879541], ["golpe", 1.890916, 2.311374], ["Spoiler", 3.090916, 3.670457], ["saldrías", 3.931833, 4.454541], ["volando", 4.465916, 4.920457]], "dur": 5.240457}, {"text": "Ahora mismo giras a unos mil seiscientos setenta kilómetros por hora en el ecuador. No lo notas, porque todo gira contigo.", "words": [["Ahora", 0.095458, 0.402291], ["mismo", 0.413625, 0.743166], ["giras", 0.754541, 1.118166], ["a", 1.129541, 1.174999], ["unos", 1.186375, 1.459083], ["mil", 1.470458, 1.606833], ["seiscientos", 1.618166, 2.140874], ["setenta", 2.152291, 2.538666], ["kilómetros", 2.55, 3.163625], ["por", 3.175, 3.334083], ["hora", 3.345458, 3.504541], ["en", 3.515916, 3.595457], ["el", 3.606833, 3.709124], ["ecuador", 3.720458, 4.209083], ["No", 4.988625, 5.181791], ["lo", 5.193166, 5.284082], ["notas", 5.295458, 5.727291], ["porque", 5.931833, 6.204541], ["todo", 6.215916, 6.465916], ["gira", 6.477291, 6.727291], ["contigo", 6.738625, 7.261333]], "dur": 7.581333}, {"text": "Pero si frenara de golpe, tú, los edificios y el aire seguirían avanzando hacia el este.", "words": [["Pero", 0.095458, 0.277291], ["si", 0.288625, 0.413625], ["frenara", 0.425, 0.8], ["de", 0.811375, 0.902291], ["golpe", 0.913625, 1.3], ["tú", 1.561375, 1.743208], ["los", 2.038625, 2.175], ["edificios", 2.186375, 2.8], ["y", 2.811375, 2.902291], ["el", 2.913625, 3.02725], ["aire", 3.038625, 3.265916], ["seguirían", 3.277291, 3.777291], ["avanzando", 3.788625, 4.3], ["hacia", 4.311375, 4.527291], ["el", 4.538625, 4.618166], ["este", 4.629541, 4.947707]], "dur": 5.267707000000001}, {"text": "El viento llegaría a velocidades supersónicas y lo arrasaría todo.", "words": [["El", 0.095458, 0.277291], ["viento", 0.288625, 0.572708], ["llegaría", 0.584083, 1.015916], ["a", 1.027291, 1.0499989], ["velocidades", 1.061375, 1.618208], ["supersónicas", 1.629541, 2.413624], ["y", 2.425, 2.504541], ["lo", 2.515916, 2.606832], ["arrasaría", 2.618166, 3.140874], ["todo", 3.152291, 3.515916]], "dur": 3.8359159999999997}, {"text": "Los océanos se desbordarían sobre los continentes en olas gigantes.", "words": [["Los", 0.095458, 0.288624], ["océanos", 0.3, 0.697708], ["se", 0.709083, 0.788624], ["desbordarían", 0.8, 1.436375], ["sobre", 1.447708, 1.720416], ["los", 1.731833, 1.868208], ["continentes", 1.879541, 2.481832], ["en", 2.493166, 2.606791], ["olas", 2.618166, 2.845457], ["gigantes", 2.856833, 3.493208]], "dur": 3.813208}, {"text": "Después, un día duraría un año entero: seis meses de sol abrasador y seis de noche helada.", "words": [["Después", 0.095458, 0.618166], ["un", 0.936375, 1.015916], ["día", 1.027291, 1.209124], ["duraría", 1.220458, 1.652291], ["un", 1.663625, 1.8], ["año", 1.811375, 1.981833], ["entero", 1.993166, 2.379541], ["seis", 2.652291, 2.970457], ["meses", 2.981833, 3.288666], ["de", 3.3, 3.368166], ["sol", 3.379541, 3.606832], ["abrasador", 3.618166, 4.084082], ["y", 4.095458, 4.140916], ["seis", 4.152291, 4.436374], ["de", 4.447708, 4.527249], ["noche", 4.538625, 4.845458], ["helada", 4.856833, 5.243208]], "dur": 5.563208}, {"text": "Los polos casi no notarían el frenazo, pero la vida, tal como la conocemos, no sobreviviría.", "words": [["Los", 0.095458, 0.299999], ["polos", 0.311375, 0.595458], ["casi", 0.606833, 0.890916], ["no", 0.902291, 1.049999], ["notarían", 1.061375, 1.493208], ["el", 1.504541, 1.595457], ["frenazo", 1.606833, 2.061374], ["pero", 2.311375, 2.493208], ["la", 2.504541, 2.584082], ["vida", 2.595458, 2.890916], ["tal", 3.163625, 3.334083], ["como", 3.345458, 3.549999], ["la",